{"excerpt_hash": "sha256:75f103bff0bc201fc358f8cd8936dcee", "kind": "utterance", "source_index": 8, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "No git history to consult, so let me reason from the scripts and data. Let me look for any other related files:", "turn_key": "sha256:9265fcfa6ef9230e6128f05cfff5903b"}
